---
intent: >
  Active drift after the root revision (2026-04-25): the spec authors a
  five-state tagged union (`ok`, `no-brain-aide`, `no-mcp-entry`,
  `invalid-path`, `mcp-drift`), stats `rootPath` as a load-bearing
  detection step, and threads `connector` as descriptive metadata on
  every returned shape. Under the new root, `rootPath` is removed from
  the brain.aide schema, the `invalid-path` state goes away with it,
  the package never stats a path, and `connector` is renamed to `name`.
misalignment:
  - spec-gap
